# Simulink / MATLAB build artifacts.
# These regenerate on every run and are binary, so they merge for nobody.
# setupHarness.m redirects most of them to LOCALAPPDATA, but anyone who runs
# a model without calling setupHarness first will drop them here again.
slprj/
slcov_output/
*.slxc
*.autosave
*.asv
*.mex*
codegen/

# Simulink Test harness registration. Harnesses are recreated by model_test,
# and buildDCLinkLoop() rewrites the model from scratch, so a committed
# harnessInfo points at things that no longer exist.
*_harnessInfo.xml
*_draft_harness.slx
*_final_harness.slx

# Generated reports. Timestamped, one per run, and reproducible with
# runAll(Report = true) -- keep the generator in git, not its output.
results/reports/

# Regression baselines ARE tracked on purpose. A baseline is the reference
# a regression check compares against, so it has to travel with the code:
# !results/baseline/
